NexusRoles contains multiple works with different authors and licensing terms.
There is no single blanket license for the complete repository or release.

## NexusRoles original contributions

Original code and text written for the earlier NuageRoles project by Théo Hay
are offered under the MIT License, reproduced in `LICENSE-MIT.txt`. This grant
covers only contributions that Théo Hay is authorized to license. It does not
cover third-party or inherited work.

## Inherited code

NexusRoles is based on REPO Roles Classic and the earlier REPORoles project.
The original authors retain copyright in their contributions. The upstream
REPORoles Classic page states that its code license applies to code, but this
repository does not contain a verified copy of that license. No new license
or redistribution permission for inherited code is granted by this file.
See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and verify the upstream license/permission before
redistributing the source or binaries.

## Replacement art and bundled third-party material

Replacement textures credited to Navrim are identified in
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` as CC BY 4.0; that attribution applies only to those
assets and only if the stated provenance is accurate. The current geometric
`assets/icon.png` is generated by the included `tools/create_icon.py` script and
uses no third-party image or font. The project maintainer offers this icon under
CC BY 4.0, attributed to NexusRoles / Stanis12. The earlier Tumblr-supplied image
is excluded from version control and release archives.

The Noto Sans font license text is included at
`assets/unity/NexusRolesAssetBundle/Assets/NexusRoles/SourceArt/Gui/NotoSans-OFL.txt`.
That notice applies only to Noto Sans font material and not to the rest of this
project.

The game, its assets, trademarks, and the separate dependency projects remain
the property of their respective owners. Dependencies are declared in
`manifest.json` and are not relicensed here.

